          "description": "A town in the Jordan Valley, the region where Midianite soldiers fled from Gideon's army.",
          "gloss": "Tabbath",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Tabbath"
    },
    "fas": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
